flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Administrator proposes Role change]
    --> C[Estimate affected employees]
    --> D[Display impact]
    --> E{Above high-impact threshold?}

    E -- No --> F[Save change]
    --> G([Completed])

    E -- Yes --> H[Display high-impact warning]
    --> I{Administrator confirms?}

    I -- No --> J([Cancel without change])
    I -- Yes --> F
